  "sdo:name": "Sail for Impact – an action-based sailing initiative for ocean impact",
  "sdo:description": "Sail for Impact – an action-based sailing initiative for ocean impact&#x27;&#x27; is a decentralized global initiative that uses sailing as a tool for long-term ocean research, stakeholder collaboration, and public engagement. Acting as a &quot;bnb for ocean impact,&quot; it enables scientists, brands, NGOs, and communities to co-create practical missions focused on restoration, education, and innovation. The platform supports scalable, modular action—ranging from Arctic kelp surveys to offshore racing campaigns—and blends expedition fieldwork with high-impact storytelling. By making the ocean personally and emotionally accessible, Sail for Impact activates systemic change through sailing, science, and community.",
